# --- Course materials, not ours to redistribute ----------------------------
# The assignment brief, the reference PDFs and the sample reports were provided
# by the course. data/raw/broadway_clean.csv is committed so the repository is
# self-contained and Streamlit Cloud can build from it; this root-level copy is
# the original drop and would only be a duplicate.
/broadway_clean.csv
/phase 1 requirements.docx
/NIBRS_DataDictionary.pdf
/nibrs_diagram.pdf
sample reports (for reference only)/

# --- Report -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Only the compiled PDF and its figures are tracked. The LaTeX sources are kept
# locally (and on Overleaf) but not in the repository, which is scoped to the
# analysis code, the notebooks and the finished deliverable.
report/*.tex
report/sections/
report/refs.bib
report/stats.txt

# LaTeX build artefacts
report/*.aux
report/*.bbl
report/*.blg
report/*.log
report/*.out
report/*.toc
report/*.synctex.gz
report/*.fls
report/*.fdb_latexmk

